    "nd_sub": "Boundaries",
    "nd_title": "What Avesur Is Not",
    "nd_p": "Clear boundaries protect the independence our assessments depend on.",
    "nd1": "<strong>Not a managed service provider.</strong> Scoped engagements that finish, not indefinite IT management.",
    "nd2": "<strong>Not a large implementation consultancy.</strong> A small, senior team on a defined problem.",
    "nd3": "<strong>Not a law firm.</strong> We interpret requirements operationally; legal opinions go to lawyers.",
    "nd4": "<strong>Not a certification body, customs broker or lab.</strong> We prepare you and coordinate the accredited parties.",
    "nd5": "<strong>Not a generic marketing agency or software shop.</strong> Marketing and development serve a compliance or market-entry outcome.",
    "nd6": "<strong>Never assessing our own work.</strong> We don't assess anything we built or remediated for the same client.",
    "about_h1": "About Avesur Consulting Inc.",
    "about_p1": "Established in 2011, Avesur Consulting Inc. is an Ottawa-based, 100% Canadian-owned and woman-led firm specializing in independent technical validation, cybersecurity assurance, regulatory and trade compliance, and cross-border market access.",
    "box_title": "25+ Years Senior IT Security Leadership & 40+ Years Team Depth",
    "box_p": "Since 2011, Avesur has served federal public sector departments, defense organizations, and enterprise clients, bridging the gap between written compliance policies and live production reality. Our technical team brings over 25 years of senior Information Technology (IT) security experience, with the last 6+ years directly focused on hands-on Cloud Architecture (IaaS, PaaS, SaaS, XaaS) and Artificial Intelligence (AI) security validation across Government of Canada (GC) enterprise landing zones and multi-cloud networks.",
    "box2_title": "Market Access, Brand & Digital Growth Team",
    "box2_p": "Avesur's market access practice is led by a Canadian former technology journalist with 10+ years building marketing systems that generate leads, and a creative director with 12+ years leading brand and digital design teams. Working in English and Spanish from Mexico's Riviera Maya, the team builds the brands, websites and search presence that carry Canadian, US and Mexican firms into new markets.",
    "qual_h2": "Corporate Qualifications & Procurement Roadmap",
    "qual_l1": "<strong>Facility Security Clearance (FSC):</strong> Active Secret (Level II) Clearance.",
    "qual_l2": "<strong>Ownership:</strong> 100% Canadian-owned and woman-led.",
    "qual_l3": "<strong>Federal procurement vehicles:</strong> ProServices Supply Arrangement (E60ZT-180024/C) submission under review; SBIPS and the Federal AI Source List (ITQ WS4286933967) on our procurement roadmap.",
    "qual_l4": "<strong>Low-dollar contracting:</strong> Eligible federal services engagements up to $40,000 may be contracted non-competitively under section 6(b) of the Government Contracts Regulations, subject to the contracting authority's rules and approvals.",
    "qual_l5": "<strong>Trilingual Operational Delivery:</strong> Native technical and executive delivery in English, French, and Spanish (EN / FR / ES).",
    "c_h1": "Contact & Procurement Enquiries",
    "c_p": "Whether you need to know if a market is worth entering, an independent assessment, a clear read on the regulations that apply to you, a path into a new market, a decoded RFP, or less manual compliance work, tell us what you're trying to do.",
    "prime_h3": "Prime Contractor & Systems Integrator Teaming",
    "prime_p": "Avesur is a senior, cleared partner for prime contractors and systems integrators bidding on public-sector and defence work that requires Secret (Level II) clearance or Government of Canada security assessment experience. We provide independent assessment capacity, CPCSC supplier readiness, or subcontracted security assessment work. ProServices Supply Arrangement (E60ZT-180024/C) submission under review; SBIPS and the Federal AI Source List (ITQ WS4286933967) on our procurement roadmap.",
